{"timestamp": 1770703970515.9927, "start_timestamp": 1770703970512, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/ai/optimize", "data": {"msg": "忙碌的 (follow your heart)散步总。"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0f1USuFa1pAgaL0QnDJa1EJs3l1USuFp", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 1529e20cf510464b8fd5429fd79db417"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1770703972542, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": "我喜欢在忙碌间隙放慢脚步，享受\"follow your heart\"的自由时刻🌿。散步是我与内心对话的方式，既能梳理思绪，也能发现生活中的小确幸🌈。\n\n在行走中，我习惯观察自然的变化🌱，从落叶的轨迹到街角的花开，这些细微之处总能给我带来灵感。这种慢节奏的独处时光，让我在忙碌中保持清醒，也让我更懂得倾听内心的声音💖。\n\n散步不仅是体能的放松，更是心灵的充电🔋。它让我在奔跑与停留间找到平衡，在喧嚣与宁静中沉淀自我。这种简单的生活方式，让我始终保持对生活的热爱与热情🌞。", "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Tue, 10 Feb 2026 06:12:52 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "Connection": "keep-alive", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "1113075-1770703970585-11641", "lubanops-ntrace-id": "1113075-1770703970585-11641", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "appservice-request-id": "14952"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
{"timestamp": 1770703983959.2512, "start_timestamp": 1770703983955, "page": "pages5/completeInfo/index", "request": {"url": "https://server-test.freeuuu.com/app-api/card/ai/optimize", "data": {"msg": "我喜欢在忙碌间隙放慢脚步，享受\"follow your heart\"的自由时刻🌿。散步是我与内心对话的方式，既能梳理思绪，也能发现生活中的小确幸🌈。\n\n在行走中，我习惯观察自然的变化🌱，从落叶的轨迹到街角的花开，这些细微之处总能给我带来灵感。这种慢节奏的独处时光，让我在忙碌中保持清醒，也让我更懂得倾听内心的声音💖。\n\n散步不仅是体能的放松，更是心灵的充电🔋。它让我在奔跑与停留间找到平衡，在喧嚣与宁静中沉淀自我。这种简单的生活方式，让我始终保持对生活的热爱与热情🌞。"}, "method": "POST", "header": {"content-type": "application/json", "loginCode": "0f1USuFa1pAgaL0QnDJa1EJs3l1USuFp", "platform": "34", "longitude": 121.397, "latitude": 31.2494, "Authorization": "Bearer 1529e20cf510464b8fd5429fd79db417"}, "timeout": 120000}, "end_timestamp": 1770703985614, "response": {"data": {"code": 0, "data": "我享受在忙碌中留白的智慧时光🌿，散步是我与内心对话的修行✨。在行走间观察四季更迭🌱，从落叶的轨迹到街角的花开，细微处皆藏灵感密码💡。这种慢节奏独处让我在喧嚣中沉淀自我，在奔跑与停留间找到平衡🔄。\n\n散步不仅是体能的补给站，更是心灵的充电站🔋。它教会我在快节奏中保持清醒，在琐碎日常里发现小确幸🌈。这份简单的生活哲学，让我始终怀揣对生活的热忱与热爱🌞，在岁月流转中保持内心澄澈与从容。", "msg": ""}, "header": {"Date": "Tue, 10 Feb 2026 06:13:05 GMT", "Content-Type": "application/json;charset=UTF-8", "Transfer-Encoding": "chunked", "Connection": "keep-alive", "lubanops-gtrace-id": "v-1113075-1770703984028-20427", "lubanops-nenv-id": "2307110", "Access-Control-Allow-Origin": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Methods": "GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS", "Access-Control-Allow-Headers": "*", "Access-Control-Allow-Credentials": "true", "trace-id": "", "Vary": "Origin,Access-Control-Request-Method,Access-Control-Request-Headers", "X-Content-Type-Options": "nosniff", "X-XSS-Protection": "0", "Cache-Control": "no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate", "Pragma": "no-cache", "Expires": "0", "Strict-Transport-Security": "max-age=31536000 ; includeSubDomains", "Server": "elb", "appservice-request-id": "14957"}, "statusCode": 200, "cookies": [], "accelerateType": "none", "errMsg": "request:ok"}, "mocked": false}
